  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with animal-based humor and internet memes. It relies on a widely understood visual metaphor (the skunk as a symbol of inherent disgust) and a satirical concept (laws to protect from hatred) that can be appreciated by people with general knowledge of animal behavior and social commentary, without requiring specific cultural or demographic markers. The humor is derived from absurdity and relatability to common human reactions to unpleasantness, making it accessible to a wide demographic.",
